2.
Definitions .-In these rules, unless the context otherwise requires,--
(a)
"Act" means the Foreign Marriage Act, 1969 (
33 of 1969
);
(b)
"form" means a form appended to these rules;
(c)
"Marriage Officer" means a person appointed under section 3 of the Act to be a Marriage Officer;
(d)
"section" means a section of the Act.
